    "htmlContent": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"tr\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>7. Sınıf 4. Ünite Özeti</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Kalam:wght@400;700&family=Nunito:wght@400;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        :root { font-size: 16px; }\n        body { font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif; background-color: #111827; color: #1f2937; overflow: hidden; }\n        .chalk-font { font-family: 'Kalam', cursive; }\n        .blackboard { background-color: #2f3e46; border: 12px solid #5c4033; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); color: #f1f5f9; }\n        .chalk-text { color: #f1f5f9; text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }\n        .highlight-yellow { color: #facc15; }\n        .highlight-green { color: #86efac; }\n        .highlight-pink { color: #f9a8d4; }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 12px; }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #1f2937; border-radius: 6px; }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #4b5563; border-radius: 6px; border: 2px solid #1f2937; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"h-screen flex flex-col p-4\">\n\n    <!-- Controls -->\n    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center mb-4 bg-gray-800 p-3 rounded-xl shadow-lg border border-gray-700\">\n        <h1 class=\"text-white text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold ml-4 chalk-font\">\n            <span class=\"text-purple-400\">4. ÜNİTE:</span> En Güzel Örnek Peygamberimiz\n        </h1>\n        <div class=\"flex gap-2\">\n            <button onclick=\"changeFontSize(-1)\" class=\"bg-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-lg font-bold border border-gray-600\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></button>\n            <button onclick=\"changeFontSize(1)\" class=\"bg-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-lg font-bold border border-gray-600\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></button>\n            <button onclick=\"toggleFullScreen()\" class=\"bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-500 text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-lg text-lg font-bold border border-purple-700\"><i class=\"fas fa-expand\"></i> Tam Ekran</button>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Board -->\n    <div class=\"flex-grow w-full h-full relative overflow-hidden\">\n        <div class=\"blackboard h-full w-full rounded-xl p-8 overflow-y-auto\">\n            \n            <div class=\"text-center mb-8 border-b-2 border-gray-500 pb-4\">\n                <span class=\"text-4xl chalk-font highlight-yellow\">Ünite Notları</span>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12\">\n                <!-- SOL SÜTUN -->\n                <div class=\"space-y-8\">\n                    <!-- DÜNYA AHİRET DENGESİ -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-gray-700 bg-opacity-30 p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-600\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-3xl chalk-font highlight-pink mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-scale-balanced\"></i> 1. Dünya ve Ahiret Dengesi</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"text-xl chalk-text space-y-2 list-disc ml-5\">\n                            <li><strong>İfrat:</strong> Aşırı gitmek, ölçüyü kaçırmak.</li>\n                            <li><strong>Tefrit:</strong> Gevşek davranmak, ihmal etmek.</li>\n                            <li><strong>İtidal:</strong> Orta yol, denge (Peygamberimizin yolu).</li>\n                            <li>\"Hiç ölmeyecekmiş gibi dünya için, yarın ölecekmiş gibi ahiret için çalış.\"</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- İNFAK VE SADAKA -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-gray-700 bg-opacity-30 p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-600\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-3xl chalk-font highlight-pink mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-hand-holding-heart\"></i> 2. İnfak ve Sadaka</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"text-xl chalk-text space-y-2 list-disc ml-5\">\n                            <li><strong>İnfak:</strong> Allah yolunda harcama yapmak.</li>\n                            <li><strong>Sadaka:</strong> Maddi manevi her türlü iyilik.</li>\n                            <li>Gülümsemek, yol tarif etmek, ağaç dikmek sadakadır.</li>\n                            <li>En yakından başlayarak yardım edilmelidir.</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- SAĞ SÜTUN -->\n                <div class=\"space-y-8 border-l-2 border-gray-500 pl-8\">\n                    <!-- SADELİK VE AFFEDİCİLİK -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-gray-700 bg-opacity-30 p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-600\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-3xl chalk-font highlight-green mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-leaf\"></i> 3. Sadelik ve Affedicilik</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"text-xl chalk-text space-y-2 list-disc ml-5\">\n                            <li>Peygamberimiz lüks ve israftan kaçınmış, sade yaşamıştır.</li>\n                            <li>\"Sadelik imandandır.\"</li>\n                            <li><strong>Taif</strong> ve <strong>Mekke'nin Fethi'nde</strong> kendisine kötülük yapanları affetmiştir.</li>\n                            <li>\"Ben lanetçi değil, rahmet peygamberiyim.\"</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- SADAKA-İ CARİYE -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-gray-700 bg-opacity-30 p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-600\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-3xl chalk-font highlight-green mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-infinity\"></i> 4. Sadaka-i Cariye</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"text-xl chalk-text space-y-2 list-disc ml-5\">\n                            <li>Kalıcı iyilik demektir. Öldükten sonra sevabı devam eder.</li>\n                            <li>1. İnsanların faydalandığı eser (Cami, Okul, Çeşme).</li>\n                            <li>2. Faydalanılan ilim.</li>\n                            <li>3. Dua eden hayırlı evlat.</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        let currentFontSize = 16;\n        function changeFontSize(amount) {\n            currentFontSize += amount;\n            if (currentFontSize < 12) currentFontSize = 12;\n            if (currentFontSize > 28) currentFontSize = 28;\n            document.documentElement.style.fontSize = currentFontSize + 'px';\n        }\n        function toggleFullScreen() {\n            if (!document.fullscreenElement) document.documentElement.requestFullscreen();\n            else if (document.exitFullscreen) document.exitFullscreen();\n        }\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
